spec se03-abandoned-commit-does-not-stall-frontier: 2 sessions, 20 permutations
# SE03, NOT NULL arm. NOT NULL on (:R).p. s0 creates an :R node without p and
# commits: the COMMIT is refused by the constraint. s1 commits x.v = 1 in an explicit
# transaction. A sessionless read sees s1's commit, and no commit is left in flight
# (InFlightCommits = 0) after either: the refused commit does not hold the frontier.
# The injected-fsync arm needs a WAL-backed engine and is #2934's.

